(2837726, 396000, 43463, '<td valign="top">BHA-HA-HA-HA! Great presentation in this composition. Warped and twisted is the  concept conveyed as well as a reference to a lot of Dali''s work which is a warped perspective. With all the colors and twisted shapes it almost appears as an abstract. Not sure if a color or B&amp;W presentation would have been better. One critique I can offer is that I think that the caption should have been normal block letters or at least made a tad more legible in the skewed form.</td>', 'BHA-HA-HA-HA! Great presentation in this composition. Warped and twisted is the  concept conveyed as well as a reference to a lot of Dali''s work which is a warped perspective. With all the colors and twisted shapes it almost appears as an abstract. Not sure if a color or B&W presentation would have been better. One critique I can offer is that I think that the caption should have been normal block letters or at least made a tad more legible in the skewed form.', '2006-09-15 10:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
