(2837886, 394143, 41521, '<td valign="top">That is a gorgeous cat.  Bengal?  Nice photo, too.  :)</td>', 'That is a gorgeous cat.  Bengal?  Nice photo, too.  :)', '2006-09-15 11:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837888, 396083, 42869, '<td valign="top">I''m not a far of the woodie pictures, even with good lighting and everything else, they seem too contrived to me.  That said, you have made a believer out of me - this is nothing short of brilliant.  The name on the box, the woodie getting sick, all of it - sheer genius.  Thank you for the laugh. - 10</td>', 'I''m not a far of the woodie pictures, even with good lighting and everything else, they seem too contrived to me.  That said, you have made a believer out of me - this is nothing short of brilliant.  The name on the box, the woodie getting sick, all of it - sheer genius.  Thank you for the laugh. - 10', '2006-09-15 11:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837890, 396056, 41521, '<td valign="top">Awesome, my favorite shot in this challenge.</td>', 'Awesome, my favorite shot in this challenge.', '2006-09-15 11:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2837898, 396070, 41521, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue on those eyes, and you''ve captured a fantastic expression (or should i say expressions?  LOL) on the pup.</td>', 'Beautiful blue on those eyes, and you''ve captured a fantastic expression (or should i say expressions?  LOL) on the pup.', '2006-09-15 11:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
