(2839151, 394099, 42013, '<td valign="top">My ''scalvert'' pick. It almost doesn''t look like a photo, more like a shaded pencil drawing(which gives it a perfect FS feel) I assume NI was used to good effect?</td>', 'My ''scalvert'' pick. It almost doesn''t look like a photo, more like a shaded pencil drawing(which gives it a perfect FS feel) I assume NI was used to good effect?', '2006-09-15 20:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
