(2839220, 395837, 43463, '<td valign="top">I get the overwhelming sense that their is an elephant in the room:-) A very humorous and, of course, warped sense of humor that is Larson''s style. Compositionally, the photo portion is really good with just one little flaw. The angle includes the roof line thus breaking up the scene of ''Mary'' totally blending into the wallpapered room. Had the elephant been totally ''immersed'' in the wallpapered portions of the room then the ''horror'' of her ''mistake'' would be even stronger. The other critique I have, and it is a small one, is that the text font is too cursive - it is not similiar in style to most of the Far Side''s typical fonts or rather his writing.</td>', 'I get the overwhelming sense that their is an elephant in the room:-) A very humorous and, of course, warped sense of humor that is Larson''s style. Compositionally, the photo portion is really good with just one little flaw. The angle includes the roof line thus breaking up the scene of ''Mary'' totally blending into the wallpapered room. Had the elephant been totally ''immersed'' in the wallpapered portions of the room then the ''horror'' of her ''mistake'' would be even stronger. The other critique I have, and it is a small one, is that the text font is too cursive - it is not similiar in style to most of the Far Side''s typical fonts or rather his writing.', '2006-09-15 21:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2839236, 395837, 50357, '<td valign="top">Very very funny!  Good job!</td>', 'Very very funny!  Good job!', '2006-09-15 21:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
