(2841512, 396053, 53316, '<td valign="top">The perspective / distortion here really enhances this shot; not only does it draw attention to the smallness of the book, thus helping the joke, but it also makes the model seem more geeky.  Shadows are maybe a little distracting, but overall is not a huge problem.  Great job!!</td>', 'The perspective / distortion here really enhances this shot; not only does it draw attention to the smallness of the book, thus helping the joke, but it also makes the model seem more geeky.  Shadows are maybe a little distracting, but overall is not a huge problem.  Great job!!', '2006-09-16 23:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2841518, 395777, 53316, '<td valign="top">Normally I wouldn''t care for this much neat image / noise reduction, but since we''re talking about cartoons it works.  It looks like you had fun with the major element clause negated, but didn''t go overboard, which is pretty cool.  I think this shot is done well, in addition to being quite funny.</td>', 'Normally I wouldn''t care for this much neat image / noise reduction, but since we''re talking about cartoons it works.  It looks like you had fun with the major element clause negated, but didn''t go overboard, which is pretty cool.  I think this shot is done well, in addition to being quite funny.', '2006-09-16 23:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
