(2842452, 395986, 10858, '<td valign="top">Cool. I mean, COWl... :-)) I like the composition and the simple irony in this one. The text bubble is done well, too.</td>', 'Cool. I mean, COWl... :-)) I like the composition and the simple irony in this one. The text bubble is done well, too.', '2006-09-17 12:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842459, 396091, 10858, '<td valign="top">The dog is sweet, maybe the eyes could be a little bit more in focus and I am also not sure about the composition. For me, there is a little bit much of the background landscape. The idea is nice, the first thing that came to my mind is a man on the other seat, with hanging tounge, looking like a happy dog or something like that. :-)</td>', 'The dog is sweet, maybe the eyes could be a little bit more in focus and I am also not sure about the composition. For me, there is a little bit much of the background landscape. The idea is nice, the first thing that came to my mind is a man on the other seat, with hanging tounge, looking like a happy dog or something like that. :-)', '2006-09-17 12:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842465, 396078, 10858, '<td valign="top">Yes, the smart irony again, what I love in the style of Gary Larson. I remember my HR lecturer showing us a Gary Larson one with bugs and an A-bomb disaster. The point absolutely caught here. Maybe the bug in the armchair could be a little-little bit sharper.</td>', 'Yes, the smart irony again, what I love in the style of Gary Larson. I remember my HR lecturer showing us a Gary Larson one with bugs and an A-bomb disaster. The point absolutely caught here. Maybe the bug in the armchair could be a little-little bit sharper.', '2006-09-17 13:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2842506, 395247, 509, '<td valign="top">Great job of personifying the horse = )</td>', 'Great job of personifying the horse = )', '2006-09-17 13:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
