(2847395, 396045, 50695, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling you just copied a Far Side, but since I can''t find it I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and say you''re a comic genius. Even if you did copy, this is a perfect execution. Eye contact between woman and horse is very strong. 10</td>', 'I have a feeling you just copied a Far Side, but since I can''t find it I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and say you''re a comic genius. Even if you did copy, this is a perfect execution. Eye contact between woman and horse is very strong. 10', '2006-09-19 12:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
