(2847402, 396083, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is my personal blue ribbon. Definitely the biggest laugh of the challenge. It doesn''t even need the caption (though I guess that might help people who don''t get the reference). 10</td>', 'This is my personal blue ribbon. Definitely the biggest laugh of the challenge. It doesn''t even need the caption (though I guess that might help people who don''t get the reference). 10', '2006-09-19 12:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2847404, 396091, 50695, '<td valign="top">This only works as a photograph, not as a comic, because the photograph makes it more real and thus more funny. I find that to be a particularly good application of the challenge. 9</td>', 'This only works as a photograph, not as a comic, because the photograph makes it more real and thus more funny. I find that to be a particularly good application of the challenge. 9', '2006-09-19 12:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
