(2847413, 396028, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this particularly funny (Far Sides aren''t always funny, either), but it''s still a well-executed pun and is more interesting as a photo than it would be as a cartoon (I consider that a good thing, since this is a photography challenge). 9</td>', 'I don''t find this particularly funny (Far Sides aren''t always funny, either), but it''s still a well-executed pun and is more interesting as a photo than it would be as a cartoon (I consider that a good thing, since this is a photography challenge). 9', '2006-09-19 12:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2847415, 395697, 50695, '<td valign="top">Well executed! I''m almost sure this is based on a Far Side, but I can''t find it anywhere, so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and an 8.</td>', 'Well executed! I''m almost sure this is based on a Far Side, but I can''t find it anywhere, so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and an 8.', '2006-09-19 12:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
