(2856739, 395777, 5792, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your second ribbon in only 15 tries. Terrific image and very Larsonesque! You are a tremendous photographer that will do very well at DPC. Look forward to seeing more of your images.</td>', 'Congrats on your second ribbon in only 15 tries. Terrific image and very Larsonesque! You are a tremendous photographer that will do very well at DPC. Look forward to seeing more of your images.', '2006-09-22 12:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
