(2858616, 395892, 326, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9. I think this needs a different text (font). The tag line was fuuny. Maybe something like this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=395889" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-23 09:50:26.</i></td>', 'I gave this a 9. I think this needs a different text (font). The tag line was fuuny. Maybe something like this here', '2006-09-23 10:48:35.000000', '2006-09-23 10:50:26.000000', 0),
(2858640, 396079, 60698, '<td valign="top">Roxanne,<br/> <br/>Thanks! I made the faces on the pencils with children''s modeling clay. It was difficult to get the tiny faces to have the expressions I wanted, but I had great time and laughed alot. <br/> <br/>Your setup was so much more involved and I have a great appreciation for your work. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=396078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/555/thumb/396078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/555/thumb/396078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/555/thumb/396078.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>This was by far the most fun challenge for me so far. I showed more of these photos around the office than any other. <br/> <br/>We all need a belly laugh once in a while.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-23 10:20:01.</i></td>', 'Roxanne, Thanks! I made the faces on the pencils with children''s modeling clay. It was difficult to get the tiny faces to have the expressions I wanted, but I had great time and laughed alot.  Your setup was so much more involved and I have a great appreciation for your work.    This was by far the most fun challenge for me so far. I showed more of these photos around the office than any other.  We all need a belly laugh once in a while.', '2006-09-23 11:18:01.000000', '2006-09-23 11:20:01.000000', 0),
