(2892410, 394201, 30982, '<td valign="top">Extremely good clone work on this!  I''ve been going back and forth between the original and the finished one and I''m quite in awe of what you were able to do.  My only suggestion - take it back into PS and tone down the yellows a lot and the reds a bit in hue/sat and see if you like it better.  Great score and great finish, even if Aimee did beat you.  :-)</td>', 'Extremely good clone work on this!  I''ve been going back and forth between the original and the finished one and I''m quite in awe of what you were able to do.  My only suggestion - take it back into PS and tone down the yellows a lot and the reds a bit in hue/sat and see if you like it better.  Great score and great finish, even if Aimee did beat you.  :-)', '2006-10-03 19:43:05.000000', NULL, 0),
